{"words": [{"text": "أَوَكُلَّمَا", "translation": "And is (it not that) whenever"}, {"text": "عَـٰهَدُوا۟", "translation": "they took"}, {"text": "عَهْدًۭا", "translation": "a covenant"}, {"text": "نَّبَذَهُۥ", "translation": "threw it away"}, {"text": "فَرِيقٌۭ", "translation": "a party"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُم ۚ", "translation": "of them"}, {"text": "بَلْ", "translation": "Nay"}, {"text": "أَكْثَرُهُمْ", "translation": "most of them"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(do) not"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "believe"}], "sahih": "Is it not [true] that every time they took a covenant a party of them threw it away? But, [in fact], most of them do not believe."}